  "prefLabel": "Pos 1501.08 Amount",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pos 1501.08 Amount.\n\n(a) Awards shall be made in the following amounts:\n\n(1) Year 1: 10% or $10,000, whichever is less;\n\n(2) Year 2: 10% or $10,000, whichever is less;\n\n(3) Year 3: 20% or $20,000, whichever is less;\n\n(4) Year 4: 30% or $30,000, whichever is less; and\n\n(5) Year 5: 30% or $30,000, whichever is less.\n\n(b) No recipient shall receive more than $100,000 in repayments.\n\n(c) The applicant shall complete an alternate W-9 form to permit payment processing.\n\nSource. #9677, eff 3-13-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pos100-1700.html"
